     "content": {
      "id": "v2-proposal-j1-022101-root",
      "type": "question",
      "label": null,
      "prompt": "Sketch $y=2^x+2^{1-x}$.",
      "questionDiagrams": [],
      "answer": {
       "short": "U-shaped curve with $y$-intercept $(0,3)$ and no $x$-intercepts. It is symmetric about $x=\\frac12$, with minimum $\\left(\\frac12,2\\sqrt2\\right)$. Both ends rise.",
       "worked": "Add the ordinates of $y=2^x$ and $y=2^{1-x}$ (through $(0,2)$ and $(1,1)$) at each $x$. Let $s(x)=2^x+2^{1-x}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}s(-1)&=\\frac12+4=\\frac92\\\\s(0)&=1+2=3\\\\s(1)&=2+1=3\\\\s(2)&=4+\\frac12=\\frac92\\end{align*}$$\nThe component ordinates swap at $x$ and $1-x$, so the sum is symmetric about $x=\\frac12$. Its lowest point is there:\n$$\\begin{align*}s\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)&=\\sqrt2+\\sqrt2\\\\&=2\\sqrt2\\end{align*}$$\nBoth ordinates are positive, so there are no $x$-intercepts. Join the points with a smooth curve; both ends rise.",
       "solutionDiagrams": [
        {
         "id": "v2-proposal-j1-022101-j1-solution",
         "format": "tikz",
         "widthMm": 52,
         "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"componentBlue\",\"hex\":\"268CFF\",\"reason\":\"component y=2^x\"},{\"name\":\"componentRed\",\"hex\":\"EF6068\",\"reason\":\"component y=2^{1-x}\"},{\"name\":\"sumGreen\",\"hex\":\"4F9B63\",\"reason\":\"sum curve\"}],\"reference\":\"j1 replacement solution\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=0.6cm,>=stealth,every node/.style={font=\\fontsize{10}{12}\\selectfont}]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{componentBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\definecolor{componentRed}{HTML}{EF6068}\n\\definecolor{sumGreen}{HTML}{4F9B63}\n\\path[use as bounding box] (-2.0,-0.7) rectangle (3.2,7.6);\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,->] (-1.9,0)--(3.0,0) node[below] {$x$};\n\\draw[black,line width=0.5pt,->] (0,-0.5)--(0,7.3) node[right] {$y$};\n\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (-0.08,3)--(0.08,3);\n\\node[black,anchor=east] at (-0.1,3) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}$3$\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};\n\\draw[componentBlue,opacity=0.65,dashed,line width=0.6pt,<->] plot[domain=-1.7:2.7,samples=120] (\\x,{pow(2,\\x)});\n\\draw[componentRed,opacity=0.65,dashed,line width=0.6pt,<->] plot[domain=-1.7:2.7,samples=120] (\\x,{pow(2,1-\\x)});\n\\draw[sumGreen,line width=0.8pt,<->] plot[domain=-1.7:2.7,samples=160] (\\x,{pow(2,\\x)+pow(2,1-\\x)});\n\\node[componentBlue,anchor=south] at (-1.35,0.95) {$2^x$};\n\\node[componentRed,anchor=south] at (2.45,0.95) {$2^{1-x}$};\n\\node[sumGreen] at (0.5,4.9) {$2^x+2^{1-x}$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}"
        }
       ]
      }
     },
